I thought I was finally going to win.  Made it to the Astral Plane
with the AoY with relatively little interference.  Started bashing
monsters there.  I had a helm of telepathy and saw a "&" a few squares
away, but didn't think anything about it.  At this point, the toughest
thing I could face was Demogorgon (or so I thought), and I had a
blessed unicorn horn to save me from him.  So, this demon advances in
line for his turn to get his body bashed when ...

"Famine reaches out for you, Your body shrivels, you faint from lack
of food"  

NO NO NO stop please!! But it didn't.  I managed to regain
consiousness for long enough to zap Famine with a wand of death, but
it was too late for me.  I tried chowing down on a nearby corpse but
couldn't eat fast enough.  Didn't have on an AoLS, unfortunately.

So, what's the deal with Famine.  If I had gone in satiated to the
hilt would I have had a better chance.  Are there any other unique
creatures on the Astral Plane to watch out for?  I had no trouble with
several Archons.  Everyone has been saying that they are the toughest
creatures in the game, so I thought I was invincible.

